      "font_size": 11.84,
      "font_name": "LMRoman12-Regular",
      "is_math": true,
      "char_count": 525,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p19_b37",
      "text": "tunable coefficient \u03b1 in (4.13) playing the role of the multiplier 1/\u03bb. In the implementation\nwe therefore use the scaled sampled budget\n",
